    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics isn't my strongest suit, but I appreciate its logical structure. It's more of a tool than a passion for me. I use it when necessary, especially in my studies, but I don't delve deep into complex theories or abstract concepts. My focus is on practical applications, like solving equations or analyzing data, rather than theoretical exploration.",
