    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I did experiment with a few AI tools for math practice, like online solvers or step-by-step guides. The experience was mixed—some were helpful for checking my work, but others felt too impersonal or lacked depth. I prefer human interaction for deeper understanding, especially when I’m stuck on a problem.",
